WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.892
In one minute, you will find the neighborhood contests, and where to vote or enter.

00:00:04.892 --> 00:00:05.961
We start on the map.

00:00:06.862 --> 00:00:10.148
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:14.362
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.362 --> 00:00:16.861
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.861 --> 00:00:18.212
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:22.340
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.037
Tap Allow.

00:00:27.261 --> 00:00:29.628
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:30.782
See the three dots?

00:00:30.782 --> 00:00:31.302
Tap them.

00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:34.961
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:36.671 --> 00:00:39.144
Live now lists the contests open today.

00:00:39.144 --> 00:00:41.431
You can vote, or enter your own home.

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:42.918
Tap Mine.

00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:46.315
These are the contests you run, and the homes you entered.

00:00:48.104 --> 00:00:51.575
Tap Past results, for finished contests and their winners.

00:00:53.451 --> 00:00:55.228
Three dots, then Contests.

00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:57.465
Live now, Mine, and Past results.

00:00:57.465 --> 00:00:59.570
And contests are on the map too.

00:01:00.976 --> 00:01:04.448
Next up: Find professionally installed displays.
